WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.400
-Super Bowl LVII is this Sunday.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.567
I am pumped for the game.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.701
You have the Kansas City Chiefs
taking on

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.067
the Philadelphia Eagles.

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:10.234
You got Mahomes versus Hurts.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.334
It's nearly impossible
to predict who's gonna win,

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:15.267
but you're in luck, because when
it comes to predicting things,

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:17.701
we have a secret weapon,
and it's puppies.

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:19.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:20.601
That's right.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:22.133
Ladies and gentlemen, it is time

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:26.667
for the "Puppy Predictors:
Super Bowl LVII Edition".

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:30.601
-♪ Puppy Predictors ♪

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:33.901
♪ Puppy Predictors ♪

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.334
-Welcome to the
"Puppy Predictors:

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:38.234
Super Bowl LVII Edition".

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:40.801
Here's how it works --
we have seven puppies,

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:43.934
we have two bowls of kibble,

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:45.901
one representing
the Kansas City Chiefs,

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:47.968
the other representing
the Philadelphia Eagles.

00:00:47.968 --> 00:00:51.767
Whichever team's bowl gets
the most puppies will be crowned

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.434
the Super Bowl champs.

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:56.734
Now, let's meet the puppies.

00:00:56.734 --> 00:00:58.601
♪♪

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:08.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.434
All right, guys, focus up
and get ready.

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:11.634
Focus up.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:13.000
Guys, let's meet them.
First, we have...

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:15.901
We have...

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.367
And of course...

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:28.367
Now, before I release you guys,
I need you to listen up, okay?

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:29.667
I want this to be a clean vote.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.767
I don't want to see
any wandering, peeing,

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.367
or butt-sniffing, okay?

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:35.033
Gary! Gary!

00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:37.467
No -- there's -- yes, Gary,
how are you?

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:38.801
You ready to go?

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:40.434
Who're you going for -- Eagles,
Chief, we don't know

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:41.467
what's happening.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:42.734
Okay, here we go.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:43.901
You guys ready for this?

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
You prepared?

00:01:45.234 --> 00:01:48.000
Okay.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.601
Release the puppies.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:55.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.167
Early lead.

00:01:57.167 --> 00:01:58.634
Early lead.

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.334
I think the winner
are the Eagles,

00:02:00.334 --> 00:02:01.367
ladies and gentlemen.

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:06.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.968
Gary.

00:02:07.968 --> 00:02:09.300
Gary, don't lay down.

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.400
Gary, you're laying on the --
you want to lay down?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.501
Come on, Gary, get up.

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:15.067
-[All] Aww!

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.033
-That's right, everyone,
the Eagles will be crowned

00:02:17.033 --> 00:02:18.701
Super Bowl champions.

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:19.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:21.834
Everybody, enjoy the game.

00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:23.968
We'll be right back
with Paul Rudd, everyone.

00:02:23.968 --> 00:02:25.300
Stick around. Good job.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:28.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.834 --> 00:02:33.801
♪♪

